--[[
    Musix - in-game music player (Delta Executor / mobile)

    Put .mp3 / .ogg / .wav files in your executor's workspace folder:  Musix/
    (the script creates it on first run). New files show up automatically.

    - Title / artist / cover are read from the file's tags (ID3 for mp3,
      Vorbis comments for ogg). wav files and untagged files use the file name
      ("Artist - Title.mp3" is split automatically).
    - Covers + tag info are cached in Musix/.cache so the next launch is fast.
    - The "S" button switches the sidebar between your Musix folder playlist and
      "songs on Roblox": search any audio by name, or paste a Roblox song ID.
]]

